Runtime dependencies: NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), SciPy (BSD-3-Clause), soundfile (BSD-3-Clause) with
libsndfile (LGPL-2.1), PyYAML (MIT). Optional: pystoi (MIT) for ESTOI, pyroomacoustics (MIT) to
regenerate the impulse responses. The codec conditions call an ffmpeg binary installed by the user
(LGPL/GPL, depending on the build) with libopus (BSD-3-Clause); no ffmpeg code is included.

The scripts in scripts/ that build the dataset download FLEURS (google/fleurs, copyright Google,
CC BY 4.0) at a pinned revision. No FLEURS audio or text is included in this repository.

